              Table "public.book_meta"
 Column  |  Type   | Collation | Nullable | Default 
---------+---------+-----------+----------+---------
 book_id | integer |           | not null | 
 isbn13  | text    |           | not null | 
 tags    | text[]  |           | not null | 
Indexes:
    "book_meta_pkey" PRIMARY KEY, btree (book_id)
    "book_meta_isbn13_key" UNIQUE CONSTRAINT, btree (isbn13)
Check constraints:
    "book_meta_isbn13_check" CHECK (isbn13 ~ '^979-11-[0-9]{5}-[0-9]{3}-[0-9]$'::text)
    "book_meta_tags_check" CHECK (cardinality(tags) >= 1)
Foreign-key constraints:
    "book_meta_book_id_fkey" FOREIGN KEY (book_id) REFERENCES books(book_id)
[exit 0]